      "content": "headphones dont really do anything. it’s deeper than that. it’s like the world is pressing in on me from every side and there’s no way to turn it down. even when i’m alone it’s still there. i just feel like i’ve reached my limit. everything is just... too much. i don't think i can keep doing this every single day.",
