    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about the hotlines and the grounding stuff but it never actually works for long. it's just a temporary patch. it's like trying to stop the ocean with a bucket. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if there was just... nothing. no more noise, no more pressure, no more feeling like i'm drowning. i just want to find permanent peace. like real silence. is that even possible?",
